Emilio Estevez, Lance Henriksen, Cristina Raines, Veronica Cartwright, and Richard Masur. 
The film is made up of four short films based on urban legends;
the first concerns a woman who encounters a killer in the backseat of her car; 
the second concerns a video game-addicted teenager who is consumed by his game; 
the third focuses on a fallen priest who is stalked by a pickup truck from hell; 
and the last follows a suburban family battling a giant rat in their home.
